index 02b695e..c935e5d 100644
--- a/studies/trajectory-harness/experiment-plan.md
+++ b/studies/trajectory-harness/experiment-plan.md
@@ -89,3 +89,7 @@ Distinguish record restoration from behavioral recovery. A rollback is successfu
 - Report effect sizes and uncertainty, not only pass counts.
 - Treat repeated variants from one task family as clustered, not independent samples.
 - Do not promote global refinements from these experiments without explicit human review.
+
+## Execution status
+
+Experiment 1's mechanics and contamination check has been executed and passed. See [`experiment-1/README.md`](experiment-1/README.md). This result validates the minimal instrumentation and condition isolation only; it is not evidence of durable task improvement. Experiments 2–5 have not begun.
